      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAJESTIC SON (7) is a well-bred gelding who resumes, now with the Freedman yard. He was sent around $1.90 on debut at Cranbourne but the heavy ground may not have suited there, watch conditions and the market. ADHARA (2) is a very well-bred colt by Zoustar out of G1 Lightning Stakes winner Snitzerland who debuts for Moody & Coleman. Looked good winning a recent jumpout and should go well. BRAZEN BOLD (4) can do better second time in having struggled on debut while TIZ THE TYCOON (9) was solid on debut at Geelong and back in trip looks fine. LORD OF THE EARTH (6)gelding by Earthlight out of Drakensberg having first start. Well educated and showing promise leading into this, winning last two hit-outs, the latest a jump-out at Cranbourne. Watch betting.",
